    <briefdescription>
<para>An owning wrapper for a cudaGraphExec_t handle. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput>graph</computeroutput> class provides a safe and convenient interface for managing the lifecycle of a <computeroutput>cudaGraphExec_t</computeroutput> object, ensuring proper cleanup and resource management. It supports move semantics, resource release, and launch of the CUDA graph.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>The <computeroutput>graph</computeroutput> object is not directly constructible. One is obtained by calling the <computeroutput>instantiate()</computeroutput> method on a <computeroutput><ref refid="structcuda_1_1experimental_1_1graph__builder" kindref="compound">graph_builder</ref></computeroutput> object. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="structcuda_1_1experimental_1_1graph__builder" kindref="compound">cuda::experimental::graph_builder</ref></para>
</simplesect>
<verbatim>embed:rst
.. _cudax-graph-graph:
</verbatim> </para>
